The bug occurs because `vmcb->rax` is directly modified during hypercall processing. When a guest resumes, the value in `vmcb->rax` is overwritten with `guest_regs->rax`, leading to the loss of the intended value that was set in `vmcb->rax`. This results in inconsistencies and potential errors in hypercall handling.

